discovered-items","line":61}],"metadata":{"title":"Configure rules to manage findings","description":"By configuring rules, you can automate, organize, and manage the lifecycle of findings. The rules help ensure scalability, data consistency, and faster response times by reducing manual intervention across large volumes of vulnerability data.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/security-management/sem-configure-rules-manage-findings.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":2,"breadcrumb":["Implement","Unified Security Exposure Management","Security Operations"],"tags":["#security-management","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/security-management/sem-configure-rules-manage-findings.md"},
